Changes:        * 0.99.8253: New NOT installed features! Read fdnpkg16.txt
                for more information!
                |* 0.99.8253a: Fixed a bug in dumpcfg with install sources
                flag being inverted.|* httpget.exe unlinks files that fail
                to download.|* Fixed alot of copyrights headers and
                variable names.|* fdinst16.exe has multipackage install and
                remove features! Which means you can install more than 1
                package with it at the same time now!|* 0.99.8253b: Fixed
                a potentional problem with HTTPGET.EXE. It deleted any
                file that has failed to download. Now it ONLY deletes if
                it has been called by FDNPKG16.EXE or has a 4th argument.
                |* 0.99.8253c: Updated translations. Polished
                somethings with the code. Functionally should be the same
                as previous minor version.
                |* 0.99.8253d: Kitten library updated! fdinst16.exe now 
                has / support so now u can use /install or /in to install
                a package
